{"id":"295ebb9be4755370","group":"90","path":"90/90-fact-godel-number-effective.md","title":"fact-godel-number-effective — Gödel Numbering is Effective","display":"fact-godel-number-effective — Gödel Numbering is Effective","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-fact-godel-number-effective","aliases":["90-fact-godel-number-effective"],"display":"fact-godel-number-effective — Gödel Numbering is Effective","depends_on":["[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-effective-procedure]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-fact-godel-number-effective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-fact-godel-number-effective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-godel-number-effective — Gödel Numbering is Effective"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> (effectively presented countable syntactic domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:E\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:E\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (Gödel numbering)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup E\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup E\\)</span> (partial decoder)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Effective}\\)</span> (effective-procedure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\)</span> (recursive unary-relation class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}godel\\text{-}number\\text{-}effective}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Effective}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Effective}(d)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}godel\\text{-}number\\text{-}effective}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Effective}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Effective}(d)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>结论分别记录编码、合法性判定和解码的有效性；单射本身并不蕴含这些性质。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的定义域恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(g)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\)</span>，并在该域上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(g(a))=a\">\\(d(g(a))=a\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effective-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)$ (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Effective}$ (effective-procedure predicate, see [[90-df-effective-procedure]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecPred}_1$ (recursive unary-relation class, see [[90-df-recursive-function-class]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"g:E\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Effective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}godel\\text{-}number\\text{-}effective}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_E(g,d)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Effective}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Effective}(d)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(g)","display":false},{"tex":"d(g(a))=a","display":false}],"bytes":1331,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-fact-diagonal-function-recursive.md]]\n[[90-fact-godel-number-effective.md]]\n[[90-fact-normal-system-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-fact-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[90-fact-paradox-equivalence.md]]\n[[90-fact-proof-predicate-pr.md]]\n[[90-fact-representation-implies-numeralwise.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b86b211a75cf1748","4de0ebda11529dc6","137d75d038de4a47"]}